{
  "title": "Dua for protection of valubales and precious things (that are concealed)",
  "code": "012",
  "data": "Thirty-fourth: quoted from 'Uddat al-Da'i too, the Holy Imams (a) are reported to have said that the savings on which [Surah al-Qadr](A101) is recited will be guarded.\nThirty-fifth: Imam Ali, Amir al-Mu'minin (a), is also reported to have said: whoever recites one hundred verses of the Holy Qur'an and follows it by repeating this word seven times, will be able to uproot even a rock if he prays Almighty Allah for so:\nيَا اَللهُ\nYAA ALLAAH\nO Allah,"
}
